From 569ebbaa0c5d31c827cb2c8d5764a9de882b6ceb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Telaak <joseph@telaak.dev>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:45:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 17/21] gallium/sgx: add state, programs and the draw path

Pipe state objects, shader variants (programs are compiled per state that
changes the code: texture formats, the colour output format, flat shading),
and the draw path: vertex fetch to the TA, with a cache for vertex data
drawn every frame and a zero-copy path for resident buffers.

Assisted-by: LLM
